---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Field Expedition - June | Portal of Aramu Muru | Primigenias 33 Institute" description="The Interdimensional Threshold">
  <Header />

  <main class="page-main">
    <section class="page-header hero-bg-overlay" style="background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(10,10,14,0.7), var(--bg-dark)), url('/images/aramu-muru.png');">
      <div class="container text-center scroll-reveal">
        <a href="/en/eventos-presenciales/" class="back-link">← Back to Annual Program</a>
        <h1 class="page-title text-gradient-flame" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Field Expedition - June | Portal of Aramu Muru</h1>
        <p class="lead">The Interdimensional Threshold</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container text-content-box glass-panel breathing-glow">
        
        <div class="detail-block">
          <h3 style="color: var(--accent-cyan);">Climate & Season</h3>
          <p>Altiplano winter. Coincides with the winter solstice (Inti Raymi), a cosmic window when the Earth is geometrically aligned with cosmic radiation streams. The cold is crisp and dry, with cloudless starlit skies.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="detail-block">
          <h3 style="color: var(--accent-gold);">Brief Mystical History</h3>
          <p>An imposing megalithic stone structure featuring a blind door carved into the rock face and two side channels for the arms. Legend recounts that the Inca solar priest Aramu Muru fled the conquerors carrying a golden solar disc to activate the stone portal and transcend dimensions. He placed the disc into a central indentation; the rock dissolved into crystalline light and he walked through, ascending into eternity. Regarded as one of the most magnetic and enigmatic sanctuaries of the Andes, it is not conventional masonry, but a massive portal carved directly into a natural monolith of red jasper stone.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="detail-block">
          <h3 style="color: var(--accent-orange);">Subjects of Work</h3>
          <p>Aramu Muru operates as a frequency modulator and a sacred geometry resonator. It provides the exact environmental matrix to confront the Maximum Tension Point, the Birth Home, and the sovereign Exit Door. The student physically interfaces with the stone portal; the conductivity of the rock crystal and ambient frequency trigger an energetic breakthrough that shatters deepest subconscious resistances.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center" style="margin-top: 4rem;">
          <a href="https://wa.me/51967747483" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
            Inquire Dates on WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-main { padding-bottom: 4rem; }
  .page-header { padding: 5rem 1rem; text-align: center; background-position: center; background-size: cover; }
  .page-title { font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 1rem 0; }
  .back-link { color: var(--accent-cyan); text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
  .back-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .text-content-box { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem; border-radius: 16px; margin-top: -3rem; position: relative; z-index: 10; text-align: left; }
  .detail-block { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .detail-block h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .detail-block p { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.8; }
</style>
